  "sourceTitle": "Herb Pasta",
  "sourceText": "Herb Pasta\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, January 1, 2010 - 12:10am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon Total of any combination\nSage, rosemary, oregano\nThyme, chervil, marjor\nOr basil\n3 Eggs\n2 1/4 cups Semolina flour\n1 tablespoon Olive oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Beat the eggs w/ the oil. Blend egg mixture w/ herbs. Slowly add flour and knead into a smooth ball. Use machine, or hand roll.",
